        <td width="20" />
        <td>
            <br />
            <p>
                Receive Lightning and on-chain payments into this store's own <a href="https://satora.io" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Satora</a> wallet, and spend from it through payouts and withdrawals. The wallet runs on Arkade, and its keys stay on this BTCPay server.<br />
